{"title":"Car Insurance Prices Reportedly Fell 5.1%—Did Your Renewal?","description":"Car insurance prices reportedly fell 5.1% over a year, but your renewal bill may tell a different story. An October 6, 2026, Money Talks News report highlights that contrast for U.S. drivers. We examine the reported decline alongside the renewal-bill question, without treating that percentage as a guaranteed discount on your policy. The takeaway is to check your own renewal rather than assume a headline describes your bill.\n\nFor entertainment and informational purposes only. This is not financial, legal, medical, or other professional advice. Consult a qualified professional about your circumstances. We are not responsible for decisions or results based on this video.\n\n#bestcarinsurance #bestcarinsurancecompaniesUSA #carinsurancerenewalincrease #carinsuranceprices #ErieInsurancereviews","tags":["best car insurance","best car insurance companies USA","car insurance renewal increase","car insurance prices","Erie Insurance reviews","Amica car insurance","State Farm auto insurance","Wawanesa car insurance","Shelter Insurance reviews","Nationwide usage based insurance"],"fallback_query":"American auto insurance agents","frame":"classic","frame_color":"#ffffff","voice_id":"iP95p4xoKVk53GoZ742B","voice_gender":"male","music_mood":"light rhythmic instrumental groove, warm keys, crisp soft percussion, curious and approachable, steady moderate energy, no ominous tension, no sirens or trailer impacts","sfx":true,"voice_provider":"elevenlabs","audio_provider":"elevenlabs","reporter_on":false,"hook":"Car insurance prices reportedly fell 5.1% over a year—not necessarily your renewal.","reporter_prompt":"Five-second horizontal opening with a middle-aged American male reporter wearing a blue polo inside a real American auto insurance agency, with an agent consulting a customer and auto policy folders visible behind him. Warm daylight, approachable conversational delivery. Use real US stock footage throughout the subsequent scenes. Production design throughout: full-bleed exact-subject moving footage, charcoal panels, orange emphasis, white bold condensed headings, deep green comparison panels, su","scenes":[{"text":"J.D. Power's 2026 survey names regional car insurance satisfaction leaders. They're a starting point for quotes—not a guarantee of lower premiums.","query":"insurance agency American","subject":"insurance agency","visual":{"type":"title","headline":"INSURANCE AGENCY","color":"dark"},"clip":{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2024/06/06/215611_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"phlyingdoctor (Pixabay)"},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2024/06/06/215611_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"phlyingdoctor (Pixabay)"},{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2015/11/27/1406-147169807_medium.mp4","kind":"video","author":"Vimeo-Free-Videos (Pixabay)"}],"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"The supplied price headline doesn't establish the measure or comparison dates, so it can't tell you whether your renewal should fall.","query":"policyholder American paperwork","subject":"policyholder","visual":{"type":"title","headline":"POLICYHOLDER","color":"dark"},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2016/01/12/1906-151662326_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"VariousPhotography (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2016/01/12/1906-151662326_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"VariousPhotography (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"So which insurer deserves your quote request? The strongest choice depends partly on where you live.","query":"insurance customer American office","subject":"insurance customer","visual":{"type":"title","headline":"BEST FOR YOUR LOCATION","sub":"The strongest choice depends partly on where you live.","color":"green"},"clips":[{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563161084-d8d8ff841bae?ixid=M3wxMDkyNjk3fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mjh8fGRyaXZpbmd8ZW58MXx8fHwxNzkxMzQxNTg3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=2400&fit=max&q=85","kind":"photo","author":"Cristofer Maximilian (Unsplash)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563161084-d8d8ff841bae?ixid=M3wxMDkyNjk3fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mjh8fGRyaXZpbmd8ZW58MXx8fHwxNzkxMzQxNTg3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=2400&fit=max&q=85","kind":"photo","author":"Cristofer Maximilian (Unsplash)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"J.D. Power's 2026 satisfaction results identify regional leaders, not one nationwide winner for every driver.","query":"insurance agent American consultation","subject":"insurance agent","visual":{"type":"title","headline":"REGIONAL SATISFACTION LEADERS","sub":"J.D. Power • June 9, 2026","color":"dark"},"clips":[{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g9efeb83ed490ea2f21de7d7fa733ed16eeec81729f00f0682a32b25a5a84619fb6e9691263533cc5267a2308afb0b2004691b08c551ce32721dc337ab2579249_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"tyler_clemmensen (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g9efeb83ed490ea2f21de7d7fa733ed16eeec81729f00f0682a32b25a5a84619fb6e9691263533cc5267a2308afb0b2004691b08c551ce32721dc337ab2579249_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"tyler_clemmensen (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"Here's a five-company shortlist, ordered by their selected regional scores. This isn't a national ranking.","query":"couple American insurance consultation","subject":"couple","visual":{"type":"title","headline":"5 COMPANIES TO CONSIDER","sub":"Selected regional scores—not national rankings","color":"green"},"clips":[{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g0d09e31d5e917e0786457e7aebefa18cb2ef9435a6ac7bca8cbdf81ed643d9b21b1fd9cf0e03df01181df33107012d5ccb35b7bb6436a074dcec9138c9a8efbf_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"18193486 (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g0d09e31d5e917e0786457e7aebefa18cb2ef9435a6ac7bca8cbdf81ed643d9b21b1fd9cf0e03df01181df33107012d5ccb35b7bb6436a074dcec9138c9a8efbf_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"18193486 (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"Fifth on this shortlist: State Farm, the Northwest leader, with 667 satisfaction points out of 1,000.","query":"State Farm American office","subject":"state farm","visual":{"type":"stat","headline":"5 • STATE FARM","sub":"Satisfaction points • Northwest • 2026","value":"667/1,000","color":"dark"},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2022/11/19/139650-773417986_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"PicturalU (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2022/11/19/139650-773417986_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"PicturalU (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"Fourth: Shelter Insurance, leading the Central region with 674 satisfaction points out of 1,000.","query":"Shelter Insurance American office","subject":"shelter insurance","visual":{"type":"stat","headline":"4 • SHELTER INSURANCE","sub":"Satisfaction points • Central • 2026","value":"674/1,000","color":"green"},"clips":[{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559493909-ee5feb0b298d?ixid=M3wxMDkyNjk3fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8NXx8RHJpdmluZyUyMG9uJTIwaGlnaHdheXxlbnwxfHx8fDE3OTEzNDE1ODl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=2400&fit=max&q=85","kind":"photo","author":"Cristofer Maximilian (Unsplash)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559493909-ee5feb0b298d?ixid=M3wxMDkyNjk3fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8NXx8RHJpdmluZyUyMG9uJTIwaGlnaHdheXxlbnwxfHx8fDE3OTEzNDE1ODl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=2400&fit=max&q=85","kind":"photo","author":"Cristofer Maximilian (Unsplash)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"Third: Wawanesa, California's leader, with 678 satisfaction points out of 1,000.","query":"Wawanesa California office","subject":"wawanesa","visual":{"type":"stat","headline":"3 • WAWANESA","sub":"Satisfaction points • California • 2026","value":"678/1,000","color":"dark"},"clips":[{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g0a9cc6682077e9b7d6aa5e42ecbe5ae867e8f90bc240b507ed40590211931772a56330447cc9e64841868020731e67ba11794c70e169f2be268a54599a342b79_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"jplenio (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g0a9cc6682077e9